  partName: Valve Cover
  description: The Valve Cover is positioned at the top-center-center of the rocket
    engine and is made of a sturdy Plaques material, featuring a complex shape to
    cover and protect the engine's valves. This large component helps to prevent
    oil leaks and maintain the engine's internal pressure, ensuring efficient combustion
    and power generation. A notable aspect of the Valve Cover is its design, which
    must balance the need for strength and durability with the requirement for minimal
    weight and compactness.
